{"product_id":"blvk-salt-plus-ice-pineapple","title":"BLVK Salt Plus - Ice Pineapple","description":"\u003cp\u003eSavor the flavor of Salt Plus - Pineapple Ice by BLVK Unicorn, capturing heaven sent notes of tangy pineapple enhanced with a splash of menthol for a deliciously fruity iced concoction that will dazzle the taste buds.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning:\u003c\/strong\u003e This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in vape pod system and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every nicotine salts e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBLVK Unicorn - Salt Plus - Ice  Pineapple Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670548684855,"sku":"BLVK - Ice Pineapple 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670548717623,"sku":"BLVK - Ice Pineapple 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_salt_plus_salts_pineapple.png?v=1747708446","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blvk-salt-plus-ice-pineapple","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




